{"day":"2026-11-27","items":[{"alias":"xhqcankao","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"数码\" data-ch=\"xhqcankao\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"xhqcankao\">风向旗参考快讯</span><span class=\"cat\">数码</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-27T07:01:34+08:00\">07:01</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33385\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">安卓应用开发者明年起需公开地址与电话</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">Google宣布，自2027年3月1日起，被认定为“交易者”（主要指从应用中获取收益的开发者）的Android开发者必须在Google Play商店公开其物理地址和电话号码。此举旨在遵守欧盟《数字服务法》，但Google明确该规定将全球生效。由于Google不接受邮政信箱（PO Box）地址，许多独立开发者可能被迫公开家庭住址或为此支付额外商业地址费用。如果开发者的应用仅属个人爱好或非商业性质，或者开发者未在英国或欧洲发布这些应用，则可获得豁免。相比之下，苹果公司执行该法规时更为灵活，不仅允许使用邮政信箱，且仅在欧洲境内公开相关信息。\n\n—— The Verge</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33385\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;e26687f03ce1fac5bfe9fc8aac4433fabfa945aa975459219668cefc3012e608&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;安卓应用开发者明年起需公开地址与电话&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/33385&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T07:01:34+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;Google宣布，自2027年3月1日起，被认定为“交易者”（主要指从应用中获取收益的开发者）的Android开发者必须在Google Play商店公开其物理地址和电话号码。此举旨在遵守欧盟《数字服务法》，但Google明确该规定将全球生效。由于Google不接受邮政信箱（PO Box）地址，许多独立开发者可能被迫公开家庭住址或为此支付额外商业地址费用。如果开发者的应用仅属个人爱好或非商业性质，或者开发者未在英国或欧洲发布这些应用，则可获得豁免。相比之下，苹果公司执行该法规时更为灵活，不仅允许使用邮政信箱，且仅在欧洲境内公开相关信息。\\n\\n—— The Verge&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T07:01:34+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-27T07:01:34+08:00","source":"xhqcankao","topic":"数码","uid":"e26687f03ce1fac5bfe9fc8aac4433fabfa945aa975459219668cefc3012e608"},{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"全球\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span><span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-27T06:50:05+08:00\">06:50</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">欧盟领导人在预算争端上互不相让，谈判陷入僵局，周五会议取消</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">德国总理弗里德里希·默茨表示，由于各国在欧盟长期预算方案的谈判中拒绝让步，欧盟领导人已取消周五在布鲁塞尔举行的第二天预算谈判。\n\n各国领导人周当地时间四上午齐聚峰会，旨在为12月就欧盟下一个七年期预算（2028-34年）达成协议积累势头。\n\n欧盟领导人正努力敲定规模近2万亿欧元的预算方案，这是欧洲农民、基础设施项目和国防的重要资金来源。谈判将以较低层级继续推进，直至定于12月17-18日举行的峰会。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;70e937ff473d8edd3959f3289ebb2f324a0594e1e65317326d0e5446d4ffccb0&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;欧盟领导人在预算争端上互不相让，谈判陷入僵局，周五会议取消&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497191&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;华尔街见闻·财经时讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T06:50:05+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;德国总理弗里德里希·默茨表示，由于各国在欧盟长期预算方案的谈判中拒绝让步，欧盟领导人已取消周五在布鲁塞尔举行的第二天预算谈判。\\n\\n各国领导人周当地时间四上午齐聚峰会，旨在为12月就欧盟下一个七年期预算（2028-34年）达成协议积累势头。\\n\\n欧盟领导人正努力敲定规模近2万亿欧元的预算方案，这是欧洲农民、基础设施项目和国防的重要资金来源。谈判将以较低层级继续推进，直至定于12月17-18日举行的峰会。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T06:50:05+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-27T06:50:05+08:00","source":"FinanceNewsDaily","topic":"国际","uid":"70e937ff473d8edd3959f3289ebb2f324a0594e1e65317326d0e5446d4ffccb0"},{"alias":"xhqcankao","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"AI\" data-ch=\"xhqcankao\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"xhqcankao\">风向旗参考快讯</span><span class=\"cat\">AI</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-27T06:39:18+08:00\">06:39</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33384\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">社交平台X宣布上线家长控制功能</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">社交平台X在成立20年后，终于为13至17岁的青少年账户推出了家长控制功能。默认情况下，青少年账户将进入 “受保护模式”，限制敏感内容展示及针对性广告推送。家长们可以查看子女的每周使用时长、设置每日限额、筛选特定词汇、管理好友申请及消息权限，但无法查看私信、搜索历史或以子女身份发帖。X 平台安全主管Michael O’Herlihy表示，此举旨在平衡家庭监管与青少年自主权。此前，X 因平台上充斥色情内容及AI生成违规图片而饱受争议，此次更新试图改善平台对未成年人的保护水平。\n\n—— TechCrunch</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33384\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;4b6db0a48f3eb42ed2cd661219a463e881cdd187b5db2dcf30fc22990f635842&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;社交平台X宣布上线家长控制功能&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/33384&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T06:39:18+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;社交平台X在成立20年后，终于为13至17岁的青少年账户推出了家长控制功能。默认情况下，青少年账户将进入 “受保护模式”，限制敏感内容展示及针对性广告推送。家长们可以查看子女的每周使用时长、设置每日限额、筛选特定词汇、管理好友申请及消息权限，但无法查看私信、搜索历史或以子女身份发帖。X 平台安全主管Michael O’Herlihy表示，此举旨在平衡家庭监管与青少年自主权。此前，X 因平台上充斥色情内容及AI生成违规图片而饱受争议，此次更新试图改善平台对未成年人的保护水平。\\n\\n—— TechCrunch&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T06:39:18+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-27T06:39:18+08:00","source":"xhqcankao","topic":"AI","uid":"4b6db0a48f3eb42ed2cd661219a463e881cdd187b5db2dcf30fc22990f635842"},{"alias":"xhqcankao","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"汽车\" data-ch=\"xhqcankao\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"xhqcankao\">风向旗参考快讯</span><span class=\"cat\">汽车</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00\">06:09</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33383\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">美立法禁止中国产汽车取得突破，国会力争年底前通过</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">美国国会正推动通过《联网汽车安全法案》，旨在禁止进口含中国及俄罗斯零部件的汽车。在参议员伯尼·莫雷诺和埃莉莎·斯洛特金的推动下，法案已通过调整定义获得欧美车企支持，特别是解决了梅赛德斯-奔驰等含有非直接中国股份企业的疑虑。新版草案移除了对电池本身的限制，仅针对电池管理系统，且增加了日落条款。法案目前旨在争取年底前通过，这将进一步强化美方对华立场，尽管此前特朗普总统曾对中国企业在美建厂持开放态度。\n\n—— POLITICO</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33383\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;0e5067f5b53d2def89a12d5bd00810ecd1eb0f4ec1d6acd5346bcdb413700e9c&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;美立法禁止中国产汽车取得突破，国会力争年底前通过&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/33383&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;美国国会正推动通过《联网汽车安全法案》，旨在禁止进口含中国及俄罗斯零部件的汽车。在参议员伯尼·莫雷诺和埃莉莎·斯洛特金的推动下，法案已通过调整定义获得欧美车企支持，特别是解决了梅赛德斯-奔驰等含有非直接中国股份企业的疑虑。新版草案移除了对电池本身的限制，仅针对电池管理系统，且增加了日落条款。法案目前旨在争取年底前通过，这将进一步强化美方对华立场，尽管此前特朗普总统曾对中国企业在美建厂持开放态度。\\n\\n—— POLITICO&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00","source":"xhqcankao","topic":"汽车","uid":"0e5067f5b53d2def89a12d5bd00810ecd1eb0f4ec1d6acd5346bcdb413700e9c"},{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"财经\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span><span class=\"cat\">财经</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-27T02:00:09+08:00\">02:00</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497190\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">💱 外汇数据汇总</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">• LME期铜收涨222美元，报11872美元/吨。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button>