noreferrer\">Cloudflare控制面板及API出现故障</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">Cloudflare官方服务状态站点显示，目前正在调查Cloudflare控制面板及相关API出现的访问故障。受此影响，用户使用控制面板或调用API时可能会遇到请求失败或显示报错。Cloudflare强调，此次故障不影响CDN缓存文件的分发及边缘侧安全功能。目前修复程序已部署，官方正在监控运行结果。\n\n—— Cloudflare Status</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/33382\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;a8472e14b6f07011e708aa6d4f8bb22718697550fea0c4d57d167c93c8c3d2e1&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Cloudflare控制面板及API出现故障&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/33382&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T00:52:44+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;Cloudflare官方服务状态站点显示，目前正在调查Cloudflare控制面板及相关API出现的访问故障。受此影响，用户使用控制面板或调用API时可能会遇到请求失败或显示报错。Cloudflare强调，此次故障不影响CDN缓存文件的分发及边缘侧安全功能。目前修复程序已部署，官方正在监控运行结果。\\n\\n—— Cloudflare Status&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"20